'''Oh Crap''' is a [[transformation]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]'', turning Isaac into poop after picking up 3 poop-related items.

== Effects ==
* Heals Isaac half of a red heart each time a [[poop|pile of poop]] is destroyed.

== Requirements ==
Pick up 3 [[item]]s from the following list ({{dlc|r}} with the [[Item Tags poop|{{code|poop}} tag]]).

=== Activated Collectibles ===
{{collectible table/header}}
{{collectible rows | Flush!, The Poop }}
{{collectible rows | dlc = r | Brown Nugget }}
|}

=== Passive Collectibles ===
{{collectible table/header}}
{{collectible rows | E. Coli }}
{{collectible rows | dlc = r | Butt Bombs, Dirty Mind, Hallowed Ground, Montezuma's Revenge, No. 2, Skatole }}
{{collectible rows | dlc = r+ | IBS }}
|}

== Notes ==
* In an uncleared room, Isaac has 1/15 chance every 30 seconds to use the effect of {{i|The Poop}}.
* {{dlc|nr}} Despite being poop-themed, {{i|Skatole}}, {{i|Butt Bombs}}, and {{i|No. 2|n}} do not count towards the transformation.
* {{dlc+|rnr+}} Despite being poop-themed, {{I|IBS}} does not count towards the transformation.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|nr}} Poop created with {{i|Flush!}} and {{i|E. Coli}} do not heal Isaac when he has this transformation.
* Oh Crap! is useless for any character that cannot have Red Heart Containers such as {{c|???}}, {{c|The Lost}}, {{c|Black Judas}}, {{c|Keeper}}, {{C|Tainted ???}}, {{c|Tainted Keeper}}, {{c|Tainted Judas}}, and {{c|Tainted Lost}}.
** {{c|Tainted Bethany}} will get blood charges for destroying poops.
* {{dlc|r}} The [[Scat Man]] and [[High Brow]] challenges start with this transformation.

